{"id":"0712b2c295b5e410c7a517c20fe66942","choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"I'll analyze the requirements and construct the full performance plan for shot B07-S01.\n\nThe shot shows Lin Yu alone at his desk, using the pen to work through the customer detail form against the settlement form. All 11 slots need natural, filmable actions. There's no dialogue in this shot. The reaction at A0E4 must last ≥2.0s showing him stuck on a hard number, not reacting to her leaving (she's still standing at E01).\n\nLet me construct the complete JSON:","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_01a10bab38ee76dd8c39a170","type":"function","function":{"name":"submit_creative_json","arguments":"{\"payload_json\":\"{\\\"dialogue_performance\\\":\\\"本镜无对白\\\",\\\"performances\\\":[{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E0\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":0.8,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿肩膀从略偏方澄工位E01的朝向，沉沉转回自己工位E02桌面，肩线不再斜向她，右肩沉下坐稳。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E1\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":0.7,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿头颈微微下沉，视线由中景落回桌面，停在A4横版客户明细单P05第一处红笔批注的数字上，眉头轻收。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E2\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":1.0,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"右手黑色签字笔P07笔尖落在客户明细单第一处红笔批注旁的空格，工整填入一个修正数字，笔尖离纸留下小墨点。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E3\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":1.0,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"笔尖随视线滑到客户明细单第二行某位数字时停住，拇指轻抵笔身，目光反复扫那一位与上下一位数字，唇线抿紧。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E4\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":2.2,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿维持低头看第二行那位数字，视线不动，呼吸略浅，肩膀稳住不抬不喊，整个人安静停在那个难对的小数上。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E5\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":1.0,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"林屿左手轻抬，把A4纵版结算单P06从桌角推到客户明细单P05旁边，两张纸左右对齐齐平，黑色金属笔夹未脱手。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E6\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":0.8,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"视线在结算单P06对应行与明细单P05第二行那位数字之间来回比对，头微侧，眼珠左右各停一拍，确认差异。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E7\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":0.6,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"右手握笔P07，笔尖在明细单P05第二行那位数字上轻轻点一下定位，指尖微压纸面留下浅痕。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E8\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":1.0,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"笔尖横向划过那位数字划掉，紧挨右侧工整重写修正数字，写完笔尖离纸，拇指略松笔身。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E9\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":0.9,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"写完一笔的停顿里，视线从刚重写的数字回到结算单P06同一行再核一次，头微抬，眼皮略松。\\\"},{\\\"slot\\\":\\\"A0E10\\\",\\\"seconds\\\":1.0,\\\"performance\\\":\\\"目光重新落回明细单P05，笔尖沿纸面滑到下一行落字处，继续往下改一行新数字，动作平稳不急。\\\"}]}\"}"}}]}}],"created":1791197123,"model":"MiniMax-M3","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"total_tokens":19692,"total_characters":0,"prompt_tokens":18987,"completion_tokens":705,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":128}},"input_sensitive":false,"output_sensitive":false,"input_sensitive_type":0,"output_sensitive_type":0,"output_sensitive_int":0,"service_tier":"standard","base_resp":{"status_code":0,"status_msg":""}}
